    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a bit of an intense way to put it. you're saying the dissent is \"legally flawed\" because they're being activist? couldn't they just be arguing that the right to privacy is an implicit part of the liberty protected by the 14th amendment? why isn't that considered a valid legal interpretation?",
